  "components": [
    {
      "@type": "ClusterType",
      "@id": "sdc4:mc-kcam9lm7091vqtvb253ixjxr",
      "label": "Law Enforcement Governed Record",
      "description": "Root data cluster (DMType Item) for a governed law-enforcement record in CordovaOS: an incident, its investigation, and its chain of custody. Wraps the domain's data components with the shared W3C PROV-O Provenance cluster so each record carries its lineage bound alongside its data. Workflow, attestation, parties, and the system audit trail sit in the DMType's native governance slots; access control and retention apply as bound sdcgovernance policy.",
